<p>Iran’s Revolutionary Guard warned staff, professors, students, and nearby residents to stay at least one kilometer away from US university campuses in the region, saying those sites were at risk as the Iran-US-Israel conflict widens. Several outlets reported the warning on March 29, after citing reports that US-Israeli strikes had destroyed two Iranian universities the previous day — the immediate backdrop to Tehran’s message. The threat raises immediate safety concerns for international students, faculty, and nearby residents at American-linked campuses across the region. At the same time, Deutsche Welle reported that the Pentagon was preparing for weeks of ground operations in Iran, a sign the crisis may deepen rather than ease soon.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/4dTj7lc2jBCpiD9kD_OQiVths8QBNB7ekow7aZ7sOaGf4e5TShW1pyhuGikBAHQYIqW_nYwLAFncjliBZYZJ8618Th3lUE2e0lDoy4a3kh6CBKJ0UnffI_EKvIQUI7YI3Bkla6sSVoqBsAfEDL1l6MQ-PPcdyhT-Cfz-V2MJfDdYWbWNUHhBhe_sYfkwMi7xKjMp27hzlChluUtWWzzKgU1dcgEO-fe-hLJ78zKRQqNHmEoB91FULpd5Ixu2D8wNQg' alt='Skyline of Abu Dhabi, where New York University has a campus, February 28, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Named campuses: Coverage specifically identified Texas A&amp;M University in Qatar and New York University in the United Arab Emirates as examples of US universities with regional campuses.</li><li>Regional footprint: NDTV said American university campuses are spread across the Gulf, so the warning could affect multiple host countries rather than a single site.</li><li>Unusual target choice: By focusing on universities, the warning showed the confrontation had reached civilian educational institutions, not just military or diplomatic sites.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-irgc-says-us-campuses-in-middle-east-at-risk/live-76581165'>Iran war: IRGC says US campuses in Middle East at risk</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/iran-israel-us-war-iran-threatens-to-hit-us-university-campuses-in-middle-east-conflict-in-middle-east-11280780#publisher=newsstand'>Iran Threatens To Hit US University Campuses In Middle East</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/iran-guards-threaten-to-hit-us-universities-in-west-asia/article70798750.ece'>Iran Guards threaten to hit U.S. universities in West Asia</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/iran-guards-threaten-to-hit-us-universities-in-the-middle-east'>Iran Guards threaten to hit US universities in the Middle East</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/29/iran-s-revolutionary-guard-threatens-us-universities-in-the-middle-east_6751905_4.html'>Iran&#x27;s Revolutionary Guard threatens US universities in the Middle East</a> - lemonde.fr</li></ul>